mes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE`.\n- **Goal Mode (`/goal`)**: LONG-RUNNING TASK ACTIVE. Continue execution through completion.\n</summary>\n\n# Running Background Tasks\nThe following background tasks were running at the time this checkpoint was created.\nUse the manage_task tool to interact with them (e.g. to kill them or check their status).\n\n{\n  \"taskId\": \"bd892285-cca1-43cd-bb8b-d1c3128f05ca/task-338\",\n  \"toolName\": \"run_command\",\n  \"toolSummary\": \"Execute ./ops/runtime/sovra_multiagent_shm_kernel\",\n  \"description\": \"./ops/runtime/sovra_multiagent_shm_kernel\",\n  \"startTime\": \"2026-09-28T20:52:57.007552Z\",\n  \"stepIndex\": 338,\n  \"logUri\": \"file:///Users/ajoxendine68/.gemini/antigravity/brain/bd892285-cca1-43cd-bb8b-d1c3128f05ca/.system_generated/tasks/task-338.log\"\n}"}
